{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53216","headline":"诗偈 四十一 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若能相用语，教君一个诀。\n捻取三毒箭，一时总抝折。\n田地成四空，五狗牙总缺。\n色藴自消亡，六贼俱磨灭。\n阎罗成法王，罗刹成菩萨。\n勿论己一身，举国一时悦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}